    {
      "id": 69606,
      "name": "MarkJ",
      "username": "MarkJ",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/a183cd/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-08-04T08:58:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Had three fun and educational games today. &nbsp; There can certainly be a bit to keep track of too, as there can be a bit going on at once!</p><p>The first games the two of us played three heroes (I played to) and Jemsk 1, followed by two each the last two games.</p><p>Had a tough time in game three choosing the Ennead and tougher heroes! &nbsp;Getting close to death but we just made it, although had to pack up as Good Games was closing - but very likely would've won next turn. &nbsp;Good experience constantly rotating heroes, villains and environments too although it means learning a new character each time!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I played Tempest and Unity the first two games, and Expatriette and The Visionary in the third, against The Ennead and The Final Wasteland.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:48:14.020Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
