      "id": 69607,
      "name": "Jemsk",
      "username": "Jemsk",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jemsk/{size}/2770_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-08-05T03:03:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It certainly was a fun afternoon!</p><p>I had realised when I got home that I had forgotten to apply the nemeses mechanics when I played Ra vs The Ennead. I think it Ra would have been alot closer to death however as would The Ennead!</p><p>In the first game I played Legacy (vs Omnitron), Tachyon and Mr Fixer in the second (vs Ambuscade), followed by Ra and Absolute Zero in the third (vs The Ennead).</p><p>My intial thoughts on the heroes:</p><p>Legacy: very good defender<br><span>Tachyon: likes to draw alot of cards<br>Mr Fixer: inconspicuous&nbsp;<br>Ra: really likes fire<br>Absolute Zero: hurts himself alot</span></p><p>Looking forward to more games - anyone in Melbourne would be welcome to join us!</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:48:14.091Z",
