      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>It certainly was a fun afternoon!</p><p>I had realised when I got home that I had forgotten to apply the nemeses mechanics when I played Ra vs The Ennead. I think it Ra would have been alot closer to death however as would The Ennead!</p><p>In the first game I played Legacy (vs Omnitron), Tachyon and Mr Fixer in the second (vs Ambuscade), followed by Ra and Absolute Zero in the third (vs The Ennead).</p><p>My intial thoughts on the heroes:</p><p>Legacy: very good defender<br /><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Tachyon: likes to draw alot of cards<br />Mr Fixer: inconspicuous&nbsp;<br />Ra: really likes fire<br />Absolute Zero: hurts himself alot</span></p><p>Looking forward to more games - anyone in Melbourne would be welcome to join us!</p>",
