    {
      "id": 69608,
      "name": "Jemsk",
      "username": "Jemsk",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jemsk/{size}/2770_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-08-06T01:44:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><span>I</span><span> was really keen on playing more games to familiarize myself with the mechanics so&nbsp;last night I played 3 heroes by myself (Bunker, Fanatic (nemesis) and The Scholar) vs Apostate.&nbsp;</span></p><div>I started at 7pm and finished around 5am in the morning...LOL</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>It was an epic game ... and&nbsp;because I ran out of cards, I ended up having to reshuffle the trash deck once for every hero, twice for the environment and once for the villain. I'm incredibly tired today so I probably won't be doing that again soon. :)</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>I also ended up losing! (Apostate has some really nasty relics and a interesting flip mechanic). He felt like a Level 4 villain when infact he's only a Level 2.&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span>Anyway, it was a good learning experience.</span></div>",
      "post_number": 8,
