      "raw": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">I</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial;\"> was really keen on playing more games to familiarize myself with the mechanics so&nbsp;last night I played 3 heroes by myself (Bunker, Fanatic (nemesis) and The Scholar) vs Apostate.&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial; font-size: small; line-height: normal;\">I started at 7pm and finished around 5am in the morning...LOL</div><div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial; font-size: small; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial; font-size: small; line-height: normal;\">It was an epic game ... and&nbsp;because I ran out of cards, I ended up having to reshuffle the trash deck once for every hero, twice for the environment and once for the villain. I&#39;m incredibly tired today so I probably won&#39;t be doing that again soon. :)</div><div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial; font-size: small; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial; font-size: small; line-height: normal;\">I also ended up losing! (Apostate has some really nasty relics and a interesting flip mechanic). He felt like a Level 4 villain when infact he&#39;s only a Level 2.&nbsp;</div><div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial; font-size: small; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial; font-size: small; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Anyway, it was a good learning experience.</span></div>",
