      "created_at": "2013-08-07T03:31:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>LOL! I was taking my own sweet time - reading up on the rules/errata whenever I encounted something I didn't understand (which was alot since I am new to the game) and having to play three heroes on my own really messed with my brain!&nbsp;</p><p>Also, Apostate's relics kept coming back into play which was infuriating (in a fun way) and Apocalypse was drawn twice!</p><p>At least it was a fun 10 hours ... :)</p>",
